    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, if you wanna go ahead and lie to me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Throw it all out now, that's fine with me, uh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "If I'm not enough for you, honestly",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I hope you don't come back",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "When you see that I'm better off",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "When you're all broke down and you're missing us",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "When you finally figure out just what you lost",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I hope you don't come back",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I can feel you shutting off now",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Like I always expected you would",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
