          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause they all say that you get bored",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I feel it, you're 'bout to cut me out your life",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I feel it, just know that there's no second try",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
